<title>UK: BNG sets NZ$100 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets NZ$100 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     8.0	 MATURITY    30.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.438   PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
